From 00adb4c36f2c246abdb150bfb2a8b32cc67a7f14 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jason-liu-4980 <38558962+jason-liu-4980@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 21:30:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] soc: sprd: add UDX710 power and cellular transports

Add retained PM_SYS firmware startup, CP loading/control, mailbox-based SIPC transports and SIPA cellular data/offload support. Include the SIPC-dependent UART extension and shared serial helpers. Use explicit shared-memory accesses and preserve publication barriers. CP control exposes real status and operations without a fixed-text ABI node.
